===Etymology 2===
From {{bor|en|nl|pit|t=kernel, core}}, from {{der|en|dum|pitte}}, from {{der|en|gem-pro|*pittan}} (compare dialectal {{cog|de|Pfitze|t=pimple}}), oblique of {{der|en|gem-pro|*piþō}}. Compare {{l|en|pith}}.

